## Human-AI Collaboration Design Principles

| Principle | Implementation |
|-----------|---------------|
| **AI Proposes, Human Disposes** | Every recommendation requires explicit Planner approval before execution |
| **Transparent Reasoning** | Agent explains each recommendation with specific constraint data across all 4 layers |
| **Adaptive Re-Planning** | When Planner rejects a recommendation, changes a constraint, or asks what-if, the agent re-optimizes on the fly |
| **Conversational Interaction** | Planner interacts via natural language — challenges recommendations, skips orders, reorders evaluation, explores scenarios |
| **Proactive Intelligence** | Agent surfaces insights: same-customer grouping, threshold warnings, cascade risks |
| **Audit Trail** | Every decision (human or AI) is logged with timestamp and rationale |

