## Demo Flow (5-minute pitch)

1. **Phase 0** (20s): AI proactively alerts Planner — tornado detected, orders at risk
2. **Phase 1** (30s): AI shows prioritized Miami orders. Planner reclassifies one — agent adjusts.
3. **Phase 2** (30s): AI shows Ohio capacity — *"Rolling Mill is the bottleneck, not the Cutter"*
4. **Phase 3 — Step 1** (30s): AI identifies Ohio orders to delay. Planner rejects one — agent recalculates.
5. **Phase 3 — Step 3** (120s — THE MAIN EVENT):
   - Agent walks through first Critical order — all 4 layers pass — Planner approves
   - Agent walks through second order — Partial Match on material, Rolling Mill at 97% on normal shifts, suggests overtime — Planner asks "what if I add weekend shifts?" — agent recalculates
   - Agent walks through third order — gauge out of range — non-transferable
   - Agent flags cascade risk on fourth order — *"This would push Ohio Order #2025 past its penalty deadline"*
6. **Phase 3 — Step 4** (20s): Non-transferable orders with reasons, draft customer notices
7. **Phase 4** (20s): One-click execution, Plant Manager brief sent
8. **Wrap-up** (20s): "Hours not days" — highlight the 4-layer reasoning, adaptive re-planning, and human-AI collaboration

